      "subsections": [
        {
          "id": "notes-intro",
          "title": null,
          "questions": [
            {
              "id": "is-there-anything-else-i-can-elaborate-on-to-ensure-im-the-t",
              "title": "Is there anything else I can elaborate on to ensure I’m the top choice?",
              "blocks": [
                {
                  "type": "list",
                  "ordered": false,
                  "items": [
                    {
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "text": "This open-ended question allows you to seal the deal by addressing lingering questions and doubling down on your strengths."
                        }
                      ],
                      "children": []
                    },
                    {
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "text": "Take this last chance to highlight critical strengths they need, that you offer over the other candidates."
                        }
                      ],
                      "children": []
                    },
                    {
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "text": "The final impression most directly impacts hiring choices."
                        }
                      ],
                      "children": []
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "what-doubts-do-you-have-about-my-qualifications-for-this-rol",
              "title": "What doubts do you have about my qualifications for this role?",
              "blocks": [
                {
                  "type": "list",
                  "ordered": false,
                  "items": [
                    {
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "text": "This allows you to respond to any hesitations and remove roadblocks to a job offer."
                        }
                      ],
                      "children": []
                    },
                    {
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "text": "This flips the script to have them present any doubts, allowing you to address their concerns."
                        }
                      ],
                      "children": []
                    },
                    {
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "text": "Listen closely for hints on where your experience or skills don’t sync with their requirements."
                        }
                      ],
                      "children": []
                    },
                    {
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "text": "Remind them of your past successes handling similar challenges."
                        }
                      ],
                      "children": []
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "can-you-describe-a-typical-day-in-this-role",
              "title": "Can you describe a typical day in this role?",
              "blocks": [
                {
                  "type": "list",
                  "ordered": false,
                  "items": [
                    {
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "text": "This helps you understand the daily responsibilities and expectations of the position."
                        }
                      ],
                      "children": []
                    },
                    {
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "text": "Look for a clear and detailed description of the tasks and how they align with your skills and interests."
                        }
                      ],
                      "children": []
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "what-are-some-of-the-skills-and-experiences-youre-hoping-the",
              "title": "What are some of the skills and experiences you’re hoping the ideal candidate has, that we haven’t gotten a chance to talk about?",
              "blocks": [
                {
                  "type": "list",
                  "ordered": false,
                  "items": [
                    {
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "text": "This prompts them to call out must-have skills where you can make the case that you still check the boxes for."
                        }
                      ],
                      "children": []
                    },
                    {
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "text": "It also may expose where you lack “must have” skills, meaning you’re likely not getting an offer no matter how strong your credentials are."
                        }
                      ],
                      "children": []
                    },
                    {
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "text": "Listen closely to the experience they emphasize to create your pitch."
                        }
                      ],
                      "children": []
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "how-does-this-company-handle-internal-promotions-and-career",
              "title": "How does this company handle internal promotions and career advancement?",
              "blocks": [
                {
                  "type": "list",
                  "ordered": false,
                  "items": [
                    {
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "text": "Growth potential is a major factor in job satisfaction and employee retention."
                        }
                      ],
                      "children": []
                    },
                    {
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "text": "Knowing the company's approach to internal promotions and career advancement will help you plan your career trajectory."
                        }
                      ],
                      "children": []
                    },
                    {
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "text": "Look for a company with a transparent promotion process and a clear path for career growth."
                        }
                      ],
                      "children": []
                    },
                    {
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "text": "The answer here reveals how invested they are in developing staff."
                        }
                      ],
                      "children": []
                    },
                    {
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "text": "A lack of structure could signal high turnover."
                        }
                      ],
                      "children": []
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "what-key-achievements-would-define-success-in-the-first-12-m",
              "title": "What key achievements would define success in the first 12 months?",
              "blocks": [
                {
                  "type": "list",
                  "ordered": false,
                  "items": [
                    {
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "text": "Another angle at surfacing their current challenges and top priorities, where you can position yourself as qualified."
                        }
                      ],
                      "children": []
                    },
                    {
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "text": "It also defines what success looks like in their eyes for this role."
                        }
                      ],
                      "children": []
                    },
                    {
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "text": "The more their big wins align with your capabilities and interests, the better the fit."
                        }
                      ],
                      "children": []
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "what-are-some-must-have-soft-skills-you-feel-contribute-most",
              "title": "What are some must-have soft skills you feel contribute most to success?",
              "blocks": [
                {
                  "type": "list",
                  "ordered": false,
                  "items": [
                    {
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "text": "Every workplace has personality and behavior clues that unlock culture fit and influence performance."
                        }
                      ],
                      "children": []
                    },
                    {
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "text": "This exposes the key ingredients for those who thrive here long-term, and signals whether you fit."
                        }
                      ],
                      "children": []
                    },
                    {
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "text": "Mismatches signal poor culture leading to frustration and blocked growth in the future."
                        }
                      ],
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "type": "image",
                          "src": "/notes/questions-to-ask-at-the-end-of-the-interview/image1.jpg",
                          "width": 551,
                          "height": 688
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
